# Never in an image: secrets, local state, build leftovers
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/node_modules
frontend/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.logs
.run
data
kg/.scout-catalog.json
# a checkout's own domains are data (./data/kg/domains), not code — the module and the template stay
